@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

actor UserAgent

activate UserAgent
UserAgent -> Schoolbox : visits dashboard

note left of Schoolbox
    How is the request to Paperly to be verified?

    It will need to contain identifying claims for the
    user agent (SIS ID + role type), as well as some
    method for authenticating with Paperly
    (presumably a client ID + secret).
end note

Schoolbox -> Paperly : back-channel request to Paperly
Paperly -> Schoolbox : JSON response

Schoolbox -> Schoolbox : converts JSON to HTML for rendering
Schoolbox -> UserAgent : sends converted HTML as part of response

@enduml
